# 🧑‍💻 Development
# Starting Project
# Clone the project
# git clone https://github.com/DODOEX/web3-rpc-provider

# Navigate to the project directory
# cd web3-rpc-provider

# Install project dependencies
# pnpm install

# Start the project
# npm run start

